//                Boyd (KG4VCF), AI-assisted via Anthropic Claude Code.
//   2026-09-29 - Level Cal: rxDisplayCalOffsetDb, applyLevelCalibrationSetting,
//                resetLevelCalibration (console.cs:46868-46886 [v2.10.3.15]),
